it=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2fa3c52d043dd1edd72cb5f61f2321bc 3x"}, "body": "Hello sensei! I would like to send another request \ud83e\udd7a I\u2019m happy to see sensei open again! I would like something similar to last time\u2019s request! \n\nI have two pairings in mind but I do not know which one to request. Sensei can choose which pairing you\u2019d like to draw! \n\nSuisei x Shu: Reserved girl x cheerful boy (references: https://sta.sh/21wup1f3wyma?edit=1)\n\n\ud83c\udf3cSuisei: The girl is quiet but kind! She is very expressive. \n\n\u2601\ufe0fShu: The boy is cheerful and overly familiar. He has many friends and is used to talking to others.\n\nRelationship: The boy is very comfortable around the girl so he can do things like leaning against her, sleeping on her shoulder and more! But the girl is shy and her heart always beats very fast. She likes him but he doesn\u2019t know that. The boy only treats her as a friend.\n\n\ud83c\udf6e\ud83c\udf38Shohei x Tomoyo: delinquent looking boy x cheerful and kind girl (reference: https://sta.sh/2a0lquca3bh?edit=1) Ideas: petting a cat together, eating pudding, Tomoyo giving Shohei a bandaid, etc \n\nSensei can draw freely! Sketches are okay too! Something interactive would be cute though \ud83d\udc93\n\nPlease feel free to cancel or reject if this request is difficult! Thank you.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@fumifumi_game/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1000257, "client_id": 1863101, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0b17140d/uploads/origins/710c44c7-e760-4fa9-8013-cb4602c3098e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9309c2daeb0ec278e212fd3fe6ca726e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0b17140d/uploads/origins/710c44c7-e760-4fa9-8013-cb4602c3098e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp